{"about_the_game":"Set in the suburbs of the Italian city of Naples, Gomorrah is a twisted story of the blurred lines between good and evil. <br><br>You are Nina, the daughter of mafia boss Sergio Miniero. On the night of your 18th birthday, you miraculously survive a violent attack at your party, but your father is ruthlessly killed. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017380/extras/5ad431d5fbe06df3479dce7346dbb03e.poster.avif?t=1683187811\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017380/extras/5ad431d5fbe06df3479dce7346dbb03e.webm?t=1683187811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Now you\u2019ve inherited the <i>famiglia</i>. How will you react as the leader of the clan? Will you seek peace or revenge? Be kind or merciless? <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Interactive Fiction</strong>: Experience the story, pick your battles and make important decisions! Combine a provocative narrative with strategic management phases where you choose what to do with your clan\u2019s resources. How you use your resources determines where the story goes!<br></li><li><strong>Branching Narrative</strong>: Each choice will lead you down a unique path, eventually concluding with one of 8 total possible endings.<br></li><li><strong>A Diverse Family</strong>: Each clan member has their own strengths and weaknesses. Train up your <i>scagnozzo</i> and use the right one for each job, or risk weakening your family.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Situations</strong>: While the narrative is handcrafted, the missions are procedurally generated, providing new challenges and circumstances  each time you play.<br></li><li><strong>Handcrafted Style</strong>: Watch the story unfold with epic visuals drawn by the super-talented comics artist: Luca Negri.</li><